# Basis branch: an inline u matrix of 15 values, then a named v basis. gman
# is expected to stop with RIE_CONSISTENCY.
#
# A trailing Sphere follows AGENTS.md's "RIB authoring" section, "The
# desync convention."
Display "malformed_out.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 200 200 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" [45]
Clipping 0.5 50
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
Basis [ 4.125 4.25 4.375 4.5 4.625 4.75 4.875 5 5.125 5.25 5.375 5.5 5.625 5.75 5.875 ] 3 "bezier" 3
Sphere 1 -1 1 360
WorldEnd
